{"id": "wavelet-colorfix-atrous", "name": "\u00c0 trous wavelet colour fix (image space)", "family": "latent", "subfamily": "wavelet", "plain": "Image-space. Dilated 3\u00d73 blurs at radii 1..16 give a high band and a low band, and output combines high frequencies of the content with low frequencies of the reference. Common after upscalers and SeedVR2. These operate on IMAGE not LATENT, listed since their names surface in the latent function digest.", "math": "for i in 0..4: l=K_dilation=2^i \u2217 x; h+=x\u2212l; x=l\nout=h(content)+l(reference); K=[1 2 1]\u1d40[1 2 1]/16", "props": {"operates_on": "IMAGE", "params": "levels=5"}, "evidence": [{"where": "Starnodes2024__ComfyUI_StarNodes/image_tools/star_simple_filters.py:39", "symbol": "dilation"}, {"where": "Starnodes2024__ComfyUI_StarNodes/image_tools/star_simple_filters.py:58", "symbol": "style_low_freq"}], "providers": [{"pack": "Starnodes2024__ComfyUI_StarNodes", "author": "Starnodes2024", "licence": "MIT", "kind": "copy", "nodes": ["StarSimpleFilters"], "note": "", "verdict": "TRY", "risks": ["installs software at runtime", "runs decoded or dynamic code", "paid or partner API", "patches torch or ComfyUI globally"], "res4lyf": false}, {"pack": "mobcat40__ComfyUI-PromptChain", "author": "mobcat40", "licence": "AGPL-3.0", "kind": "copy", "nodes": [], "note": "bundled SeedVR2, color_fix.py:122", "verdict": "MAYBE", "risks": ["installs software at runtime", "runs decoded or dynamic code", "reads credential paths", "paid or partner API", "patches torch or ComfyUI globally", "downloads models"], "res4lyf": false}, {"pack": "Stibo__comfyui-nifty-nodes", "author": "Stibo", "licence": "MIT", "kind": "copy", "nodes": [], "note": "nodes/image.py:437", "verdict": "TRY", "risks": ["installs software at runtime", "runs decoded or dynamic code", "paid or partner API"], "res4lyf": false}, {"pack": "ComfyUI_Eclipse", "author": "r-vage", "licence": "Apache-2.0", "kind": "variant", "nodes": [], "note": "RvImage_ColorMatch.py:68,